      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Montagio · Camera presets (two moves at once)\n\nA photo and a Montagio camera preset give a 5 s clip with a controlled camera move. **Load Montagio Preset** reads the preset file and feeds **Montagio Camera Embedding**, which runs two moves at once or one after the other (here Rise & Push: Pan Up and Zoom In together). Pick another preset in its menu.\n\n**Tip:** Write what the photo shows in the preset node's `prompt`: without it, the model invents and the clip turns ghostly.\n\n**Models**, under `ComfyUI/models/`:\n- `vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P)\n- `diffusion_models/wan2.2_fun_camera_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from alibaba-pai/Wan2.2-Fun-A14B-Control-Camera)\n- `diffusion_models/wan2.2_fun_camera_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from alibaba-pai/Wan2.2-Fun-A14B-Control-Camera)\n- `text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from google/umt5-xxl)\n\nNeeds the **Montagio** node pack. 480p, 20 steps: 1,110 to 1,170 s on an NVIDIA L4 (24 GB), peak 18 to 21 GB.\n\nOpen weights only: every file is Apache-2.0 or MIT, pinned by sha256 in Montagio's `registry/models.lock.yaml`."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Montagio · Camera presets (two moves at once)\n\nA photo and a Montagio camera preset give a 5 s clip with a controlled camera move. **Load Montagio Preset** reads the preset file and feeds **Montagio Camera Embedding**, which runs two moves at once or one after the other (here Rise & Push: Pan Up and Zoom In together). Pick another preset in its menu.\n\n**Tip:** Write what the photo shows in the preset node's `prompt`: without it, the model invents and the clip turns ghostly.\n\n**Models**, under `ComfyUI/models/`:\n- `vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P)\n- `diffusion_models/wan2.2_fun_camera_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from alibaba-pai/Wan2.2-Fun-A14B-Control-Camera)\n- `diffusion_models/wan2.2_fun_camera_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from alibaba-pai/Wan2.2-Fun-A14B-Control-Camera)\n- `text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from google/umt5-xxl)\n\nNeeds the **Montagio** node pack. 480p, 20 steps: 1,110 to 1,170 s on an NVIDIA L4 (24 GB), peak 18 to 21 GB.\n\nOpen weights only: every file is Apache-2.0 or MIT, pinned by sha256 in Montagio's `registry/models.lock.yaml`."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
